sequenceDiagram
    participant App as Application
    participant Mem as Memtable
    participant CL as CommitLog
    participant Flush as Flush Writer
    participant SST as SSTable
    participant Comp as Compaction
    
    Note over Mem: Normal Operation
    App->>Mem: Write data
    App->>CL: Append to log
    Mem-->>App: ACK
    
    Note over Mem: Memtable fills up
    rect rgb(255, 240, 200)
        Note over Mem,Flush: Flush Trigger<br/>(Size threshold or time)
        Mem->>Mem: Mark as frozen
        Mem->>Flush: Create flush task
        
        par New writes continue
            App->>Mem: Write to NEW memtable
            App->>CL: Append to log
        and Flush in background
            Flush->>SST: Write frozen data
            Note over Flush,SST: Sequential write<br/>~100-200 MB/s
            SST-->>Flush: Write complete
        end
        
        Flush->>SST: Build indexes
        Note over SST: Partition index<br/>Bloom filter<br/>Summary
        
        Flush->>CL: Mark segment safe
        CL->>CL: Delete old segment
        
        Flush-->>Mem: Flush complete
    end
    
    Note over SST,Comp: Post-flush
    SST->>Comp: Trigger compaction
    Note over Comp: May compact new SSTable<br/>with existing ones
    
    style Mem fill:#e1f5ff
    style CL fill:#fff4e1
    style SST fill:#f0f0f0
    style Comp fill:#e1ffe1